cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Confidex: per-sample confidence for ensemble classifiers (replication package of Chapters 3, 4 and 5 of the thesis)"
abstract: >-
  The library Confidex, which reconstructs from the probabilities of the members of an ensemble the law
  of a further member and reads it at the operating threshold, and the code that reproduces every number,
  table and figure of Chapter 3 (synthetic ensembles with a known truth) and Chapter 4 (two public fraud
  datasets) of the doctoral thesis "Reliability of Machine Learning Outputs in Finance", together with the
  records, the coding and the analysis script of the systematic review of generative models for financial
  time series in Chapter 5.
authors:
  - family-names: Palmacci
    given-names: Luca
    affiliation: "Sapienza University of Rome"
keywords:
  - ensembles
  - per-sample confidence
  - Bayesian inference
  - selective classification
  - fraud detection
  - systematic review
  - generative models
version: 0.5.1
